# Approval vs live restart

- Before changing code, UI, or files, explain first and wait for approval.
- After approved work that must show on port 3001, run `npm run live:down && npm run live:up` yourself. Do not ask whether to restart.
- Talk in Turkish. Keep new UI copy in English. Do not delete files or data without asking.
